    m_Localized: "My scepter is incomplete! It originally had three pairs of wings
      and a heart, but now they\u2019re all gone! Go, find them and bring them back!
      Otherwise\u2026 you won\u2019t see Alice! I don\u2019t have time to wait too
      long, hurry up and get back quickly! What are you standing there for? Get to
      work!"
